posts.body:
You can use it similar like this to change the event image
JavaScript:
$gameMap._events[eventId].setImage(filename, filenameIndex);

// example
$gameMap._events[eventId].setImage("Actor1", 6);
but you need a loop to control the index (0-7) if you want it randomly
between events.
[2,4,6,12].contains ....   and more of the code, than a loop from 0-7
for the random index. to assign it.
or you can just call the event separately to change a random value to it.
